@startuml SD_03
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #1F2933
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #1F2933
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #F3F5F7
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #8A929A
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam SequenceGroupBodyBackgroundColor transparent
hide footbox

title SD-03 Browse and find books
actor "Customer" as a
participant "ui :\nBookView" as v <<boundary>>
participant "flow :\nSearchControl" as f <<control>>
participant "books :\nBookCatalogue" as b <<entity>>
autonumber
a -> v: browse / search
v -> f: criteria
f -> b: findListed
b --> f: matches / error
alt read succeeded
f --> v: list or empty
else read failed
f --> v: read error
end
v --> a: show list/error
opt customer opens a title
a -> v: select book
v -> f: book id
f -> b: readListed
b --> f: book / error
alt exists and listed
f --> v: book details
else missing, unlisted or read failed
f --> v: unavailable/error
end
end
v --> a: show result
note over a,b
Trim keyword; match title OR author, then category; use the chosen price order.
Listed zero-stock titles stay visible but unavailable. Discovery changes no data.
end note
@enduml
